   |
51 |     let _ = user::Entity::find_by_id(post::PostId::new(1));
   |                                      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ expected `user::Entity`'s `PrimaryKey::ValueType` (or something convertible to it), got `Id<post::Entity, i32>`
